            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "The window actually applied, not the parameters as typed. `requested_to` is the\ncall's `to`, or today when `to` was absent; `requested_from` is the call's `from`,\nor the portfolio's first transaction on or before `requested_to`, or `None` when\nthe portfolio has no transaction at all. An open end is visible in the artifact\nrather than inferred by its reader.",
            "nullable": true
